    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_699 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∀ n i j : ℕ,\n      1 ≤ i →\n      i < j →\n      j ≤ n / 2 →\n      ∃ p : ℕ, p.Prime ∧ i ≤ p ∧ p ∣ Nat.gcd (Nat.choose n i) (Nat.choose n j)",
